8 3 0</s>Hi , George . I'm going to have a job interview next week . Could you give me some advice ? </s> Sure . First of all , it ’ s very important for you not to be late . Job interviewers usually don ’ t think very highly of a candidate who arrives ten minutes after the appointed time , only to explain that he could not find the place or that there was heavy traffic . </s> Yeah , that's very important . </s> So you ’ d better explore the place the day before and at the same time , look around to see what the employees are wearing . So the next day you will arrive early for the appointment . </s> I ’ ll try my best to make a good impression on the interviewer .  <En>
